# The no-audio smoke (plan §3): both wire shapes, immediate and scheduled, through the
# preview build in the headless host. scripts/smoke asserts on the output.
# A fresh session holds deck a alone, so the second deck is created before it is addressed —
# a command for a deck nobody added throws (0029).
{"t":"deck.add","deck":"b","emoji":"🌴","name":"North Willow"}
{"t":"param.set","deck":"a","param":"deck.gain","value":0.5}
{"at":0,"cmd":{"t":"param.set","deck":"b","param":"deck.gain","value":1.25}}
# Scheduled relative to the page's own clock: absolute seconds would be a race against
# however long the build took. The queue, not the wire, delivers this one — drive has to
# wait for the clock and pump before its final probe.
{"after":0.25,"cmd":{"t":"param.set","deck":"a","param":"deck.gain","value":0.75}}
